the sea and the dry land.”"},{"verse":10,"text":"Then the men were exceedingly afraid, and said to him, “What have you done?” For the men knew that he was fleeing from the presence of the LORD, because he had told them."},{"verse":11,"text":"Then they said to him, “What shall we do to you, that the sea may be calm to us?” For the sea grew more and more stormy."},{"verse":12,"text":"He said to them, “Take me up, and throw me into the sea. Then the sea will be calm for you; for I know that because of me this great storm is on you.”"},{"verse":13,"text":"Nevertheless the men rowed hard to get them back to the land; but they could not, for the sea grew more and more stormy against them."},{"verse":14,"text":"Therefore they cried to the LORD, and said, “We beg you, LORD, we beg you, don’t let us die for this man’s life, and don’t lay on us innocent blood; for you, LORD, have done as it pleased you.”"},{"verse":15,"text":"So they took up Jonah and threw him into the sea; and the sea ceased its raging."},{"verse":16,"text":"Then the men feared the LORD exceedingly; and they offered a sacrifice to the LORD and made vows."},{"verse":17,"text":"The LORD prepared a huge fish to swallow up Jonah, and Jonah was in the belly of the fish three days and three nights."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/jonah.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"jonah_2","bookSlug":"jonah","chapter":2,"reference":"Jonah 2","title":"Jonah 2 — Public Domain Study","topics":["jonah","jonah","ot","scripture","約拿書","约拿书","約拿的禱告","约拿的祷告"],"snippet":{"zh-CN":"约拿在鱼腹中祷告耶和华—他的 神，"},"tokens":{"10":2,"32":1,"jonah":11,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"ot":1,"scripture":1,"約拿書":1,"约拿书":2,"約拿的禱告":1,"约拿的祷告":1,"约拿在鱼腹中祷告耶和华":1,"他的":2,"我遭遇患难求告耶和华":1,"你就应允我":1,"从阴间的深处呼求":1,"你就俯听我的声音":1,"你将我投下深渊":1,"就是海的深处":1,"大水环绕我":1,"你的波浪洪涛都漫过我身":1,"我说":2,"我从你眼前虽被驱逐":1,"我仍要仰望你的圣殿":1,"诸水环绕我":1,"几乎淹没我":1,"深渊围住我":1,"海草缠绕我的头":1,"我下到山根":1,"地的门将我永远关住":1,"耶和华":1,"我的":6,"神啊":2,"你却将我的性命从坑中救出来":1,"我心在我里面发昏的时候":1,"我就想念耶和华":